{coi} - Hello!

{fi'i} - Welcome!

{mi'e .kribacr.} - My name is kribacr! (at least among lojbanic circles.)

Welcome to our humble organization!

There are quite a few resources available to aid in your learning! If you
are keen on using IRC, we are in #lojban on irc.lojban.org. I might direct
you to
http://www.lojban.org/tiki/tiki-index.php?page=The+Lojban+Reference+Grammar&bl=y,
the housing for the complete reference grammar if you are so inclined, but
you may be better served reading through lojban for beginners at
http://www.tlg.uci.edu/~opoudjis/lojbanbrochure/lessons/book1.html.

Best of luck and let us know if we can help!

mu'o mi'e .kribacr.

--0016364c7bc3849955046ca2d7d3
